---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | KloudXP"
  description="General terms and conditions for enterprise cloud infrastructure and colocation services."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
    <div class="space-y-8 bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-xl">
      <div class="border-b border-slate-800 pb-6 space-y-2">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-400">Contractual Terms</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Effective: January 2026</p>
      </div>
      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-slate max-w-none text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-300">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Scope of Service</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service govern the provision of cloud computing, hosted private cloud, block storage, and colocation infrastructure by Kloud Xperts to business customers.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
        <p>
          Customers are strictly prohibited from utilizing KloudXP networks or compute resources for spam distribution, unauthorized cryptocurrency mining, malware propagation, or network denial-of-service attacks.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
